  "items": [
    {
      "source": "This implementation builds a <a href=\"SimpleThrowawayClassLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.instrument.classloading\"><code>SimpleThrowawayClassLoader</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此实现构建了一个<a href=\"SimpleThrowawayClassLoader.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.instrument.classloading\"><code>SimpleThrowawayClassLoader</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Mainly intended for testing environments, where it is sufficient to\nperform all class transformation on a newly created\n<code>ClassLoader</code> instance.",
      "translation": "主要用于测试环境，在这些环境中，只需在一个新创建的 <code>ClassLoader</code> 实例上执行所有类转换即可。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>SimpleLoadTimeWeaver</code> for the current context\n<code>ClassLoader</code>.",
      "translation": "为当前上下文的 <code>ClassLoader</code> 创建一个新的 <code>SimpleLoadTimeWeaver</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <code>SimpleLoadTimeWeaver</code> for the given\n<code>ClassLoader</code>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <code>ClassLoader</code> 创建一个新的 <code>SimpleLoadTimeWeaver</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Add a <code>ClassFileTransformer</code> to be applied by this\n<code>LoadTimeWeaver</code>.",
      "translation": "添加一个由本<code>LoadTimeWeaver</code>应用的<code>ClassFileTransformer</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>classLoader</code> - the <code>ClassLoader</code> to build a simple\ninstrumentable <code>ClassLoader</code> on top of",
      "translation": "<code>classLoader</code> - 用于在其之上构建简单可插桩 <code>ClassLoader</code> 的 <code>ClassLoader</code>",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "May be the current <code>ClassLoader</code>, or a <code>ClassLoader</code>\ncreated by this <a href=\"LoadTimeWeaver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.instrument.classloading\"><code>LoadTimeWeaver</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "可能是当前的 `<code>ClassLoader</code>`，或由该 `<a href=\"LoadTimeWeaver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.instrument.classloading\"><code>LoadTimeWeaver</code></a>` 实例创建的 `<code>ClassLoader</code>`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a <code>ClassLoader</code> that supports instrumentation\nthrough AspectJ-style load-time weaving based on user-defined\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.instrument/java/lang/instrument/ClassFileTransformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.instrument\"><code>ClassFileTransformers</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个支持基于用户定义的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.instrument/java/lang/instrument/ClassFileTransformer.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.instrument\"><code>ClassFileTransformers</code></a>进行 AspectJ 风格加载时织入的<code>ClassLoader</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"LoadTimeWeaver.html#addTransformer(java.lang.instrument.ClassFileTransformer)\">LoadTimeWeaver</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"LoadTimeWeaver.html#addTransformer(java.lang.instrument.ClassFileTransformer)\">LoadTimeWeaver</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
