      "translation": "`<code><a href=\"LoadTimeWeaver.html#addTransformer(java.lang.instrument.ClassFileTransformer)\">addTransformer</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a href=\"LoadTimeWeaver.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.instrument.classloading\">LoadTimeWeaver</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 1
